Revision history for Image::PNG::Portable

{{$NEXT}}

0.3.3  2026-09-29T11:41:13+01:00
    - Correctly bump version

0.3.2  2026-09-28T18:13:20+01:00
    - Test::Coverage is no longer a test dependency. Only the author test
      xt/coverage.rakutest uses it, and zef does not run xt/ on install, so
      every install of a dependent pulled in the coverage toolchain for
      nothing. That toolchain (MoarVM::Bytecode) fails its tests on
      Rakudo 2026.09, which blocked installing anything that depends on
      this module.

0.3.2  2025-07-09T15:02:34+01:00
    - Fixed a bug where numeric keys in tExt failed to parse

0.3.1  2025-07-09T10:52:50+01:00
    - Improve file reading performance (MasterDuke17)

0.3  2025-07-09T10:45:51+01:00
    - Add metadata support

